5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hey everyone! I'm so excited for the training camp! To make sure it's fair and fun for everyone, we should really look into the costs and how we get there. What do you all think?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see your enthusiasm, Mio. I agree that costs are important, but let us also ensure we choose a place where everyone feels welcome and can truly bond with one another.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should also consider the administrative burden. If the destination requires too much preparation or on-site duty, it will be unfair to the organizers. We need a balance between cost, logistics, and the workload involved.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want it to be a real adventure! But we can't have fun if we're too tired to move. We need to make sure the place is actually comfortable so everyone stays energized!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. We need to be realistic about the budget. To avoid any surprises, we should carefully examine the actual expenses from previous years and the current pricing for facilities.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll take a look at the group transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets! I want to see if we can find a way to keep the costs balanced for everyone.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the attendance sheets for the away camps. I want to make sure we create a space where everyone feels they belong.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I will check the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, as well as the lottery and application for public group bookings. I want to see how much labor is actually required for the organizers.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'll check the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds! I want to see where people actually slept well and what the rooms are like!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will check the vacation timetable for the club's own hall and the membership list against first-train times. I want to ensure we have a clear picture of our available resources and timing.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,That sounds like a great plan! We've covered almost everything. I'm really curious to see if those whole-building lets can save us money or make things simpler for the group!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It is a relief to see us working together so harmoniously. I hope the information I find will help us bring the younger and older members closer together this year.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Efficiency is key. If we can identify which options minimize the manual labor for the organizers, we can ensure the camp is sustainable and that no one is unfairly burdened with chores.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm going to find the best spot! If we find a place that's super cozy, everyone will be in a great mood for the training. I can't wait to see what I find!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Let's stay focused. Once we have the data, we can compare the options objectively. I want to make sure we don't overlook any hidden costs that could affect the club's finances.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm on it! I'll dive into those receipts and quotes right away. Let's all meet back here soon and share what we've found so we can pick the perfect spot!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall do the same. I look forward to hearing what you all discover. Let us hope for a destination that brings us all closer together.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will begin my research. I intend to find a solution that doesn't sacrifice the organizers' own training time for the sake of the camp. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm off to investigate! I'll find out which places are the comfiest so we don't end up like zombies on the last day. See you all soon!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will start my research now. I'll be looking for any discrepancies or constraints that might impact our planning. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
